.* QUIREGINF: WRKREGINF (the exit points), its option 5 DSPEXITPNT and
.* option 8 WRKEXITPGM (a point's programs) with its option 5
.* DSPEXITPGM. The registered column's values come centered from the
.* driver, as the golden shows them.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=POINTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 20'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=FMTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 8'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=REGCL BASETYPE='CHAR 7'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=VALCL BASETYPE='CHAR 30'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NBRCL BASETYPE='ZONED 10 0'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=EPNAME CLASS=POINTCL.
:VAR NAME=EPFMT CLASS=FMTCL.
:VAR NAME=EPREGD CLASS=REGCL.
:VAR NAME=EPTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=EPREG CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=EPDEREG CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=EPMAX CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=EPCOUNT CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=EPADDP CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=EPADDL CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=EPADDF CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=EPRMVP CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=EPRMVL CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=EPRMVF CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=EPRTVP CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=EPRTVL CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=EPRTVF CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=EPCHG CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=EPMSGF CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=EPMSGL CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=EPMSGID CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=PGMNBR CLASS=NBRCL.
:VAR NAME=PGM CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=PGMLIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=PGTHDS CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=PGMTA CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=PGCCSID CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=PGDTALEN CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=PGDATA CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=PGTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:LISTDEF NAME=POINTS VARS='OPT EPNAME EPFMT EPREGD EPTEXT'.
:LISTDEF NAME=PGMS VARS='OPT PGMNBR PGM PGMLIB'.
:KEYL NAME=WRKKEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=PGMKEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=DSPKEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKREGINF KEYL=WRKKEYS HELP=WRKREGH ENTER='RETURN 0'.Work with Registration Information
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=POINTS ACTLEN=1 SCROLL=YES.(No exit points found.)
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 55' HELP='WRKREGINF/OPTIONS'.5=Display exit point
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='RETURN 58' HELP='WRKREGINF/OPTIONS'.8=Work with exit programs
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='WRKREGINF/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=EPNAME USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/EPNAME'.Exit                Point
:LISTCOL VAR=EPFMT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/EPFMT'.Exit Point Format
:LISTCOL VAR=EPREGD USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=7 HELP='FLD/EPREGD'.Registered
:LISTCOL VAR=EPTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/EPTEXT'.Text
:ELIST.
:CMDLINE SIZE=SHORT.Command
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPEXITPNT KEYL=DSPKEYS HELP=DSPEPH TOPSEP=SYSNAM ENTER='RETURN 0'.Display Exit Point
:DATA DEPTH=3.
:DATACOL WIDTH=40.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=EPNAME USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/EPNAME'.Exit point
:DATAI VAR=EPFMT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/EPFMT'.Exit point format
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.
:DATACOL WIDTH=40.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=EPREG USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/EPREG'.Exit point registered
:DATAI VAR=EPDEREG USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/EPDEREG'.Allow deregister
:DATAI VAR=EPMAX USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/EPMAX'.Maximum number of exit programs
:DATAI VAR=EPCOUNT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/EPCOUNT'.Current number of exit programs
:DATAI VAR=EPADDP USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/EPADDP'.Preprocessing for add
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=EPADDL USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/EPADDL'.Library
:DATAI VAR=EPADDF USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/EPADDF'.Format
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=EPRMVP USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/EPRMVP'.Preprocessing for remove
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=EPRMVL USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/EPRMVL'.Library
:DATAI VAR=EPRMVF USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/EPRMVF'.Format
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=EPRTVP USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/EPRTVP'.Preprocessing for retrieve
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=EPRTVL USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/EPRTVL'.Library
:DATAI VAR=EPRTVF USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/EPRTVF'.Format
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=EPCHG USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/EPCHG'.Allow change
:DATAI VAR=EPMSGF USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/EPMSGF'.Description message file
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=EPMSGL USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/EPMSGL'.Library
:DATAI VAR=EPMSGID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/EPMSGID'.Message ID
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=EPTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/EPTEXT'.Text description
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKEXITPGM KEYL=PGMKEYS HELP=WRKPGMH ENTER='RETURN 0'.Work with Exit Programs
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI VAR=EPNAME USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/EPNAME'.Exit point
:DATAIX VAR=EPFMT USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Format
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=PGMS ACTLEN=2 SCROLL=YES EXTACT=YES.(No exit programs found.)
:LISTACT OPTION=1 ACTFOR=EXTACT ENTER='RETURN 61' HELP='WRKEXITPGM/OPTIONS'.1=Add
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='RETURN 64' HELP='WRKEXITPGM/OPTIONS'.4=Remove
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='RETURN 65' HELP='WRKEXITPGM/OPTIONS'.5=Display
:LISTACT OPTION=10 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='RETURN 70' HELP='WRKEXITPGM/OPTIONS'.10=Replace
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='WRKEXITPGM/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=PGMNBR USAGE=OUTPUT MINWIDTH=17 HELP='FLD/PGMNBR'.Exit        Program      Number
:LISTCOL VAR=PGM USAGE=OUTPUT MINWIDTH=13 EXTACT=YES HELP='FLD/PGM'.Exit          Program
:LISTCOL VAR=PGMLIB USAGE=OUTPUT EXTACT=YES HELP='FLD/PGMLIB'.Library
:ELIST.
:CMDLINE SIZE=SHORT.Command
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPEXITPGM KEYL=DSPKEYS HELP=DSPPGMH TOPSEP=SYSNAM ENTER='RETURN 0'.Display Exit Program
:DATA DEPTH=3.
:DATACOL WIDTH=40.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=EPNAME USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/EPNAME'.Exit point
:DATAI VAR=EPFMT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/EPFMT'.Exit point format
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.
:DATACOL WIDTH=40.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=PGMNBR USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PGMNBR'.Exit program number
:DATAI VAR=PGM USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PGM'.Exit program
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=PGMLIB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PGMLIB'.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=PGTHDS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PGTHDS'.Threadsafe
:DATAI VAR=PGMTA USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PGMTA'.Multithreaded job action
:DATAI VAR=PGCCSID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PGCCSID'.Exit program data CCSID
:DATAI VAR=PGDTALEN USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PGDTALEN'.Length of exit program data
:DATAI VAR=PGDATA USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PGDATA'.Exit program data
:DATAI VAR=PGTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PGTEXT'.Text description
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=WRKREGH.Work with Registration Information - Help
:P.The exit points the system calls programs at, one line for each
point and format. Type 5 to see how a point is set up, or 8 to see,
add and remove the programs registered on it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=DSPEPH.Display Exit Point - Help
:P.How an exit point is set up: whether it may be deregistered and
changed, how many programs it takes and has, and the programs the
system names to check additions, removals and retrievals.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=WRKPGMH.Work with Exit Programs - Help
:P.The programs called at one exit point, in the order of their
numbers. Type 1 to add one, 4 to remove one, 5 to see one, or 10 to
replace one, and press Enter.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=DSPPGMH.Display Exit Program - Help
:P.One exit program: its number, its library, how a job with several
threads treats it, and the data handed to whoever calls it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=KEYSHLP.Function keys - Help
:P.F3 leaves the display, F12 goes back one display, F4 prompts the
command typed, F5 reads the programs again and F9 brings back the
last command.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='WRKREGINF/OPT'.Option
:P.Type the number of an option next to an entry and press Enter. The
options the list allows are shown above it; F1 on one of them explains
it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/EPNAME'.Exit                Point
:P.The exit Point of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/EPFMT'.Exit Point Format
:P.The exit Point Format of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/EPREGD'.Registered
:P.The registered of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/EPTEXT'.Text
:P.The text of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKREGINF/OPTIONS'.Options
:P.Type an option number next to one or more entries and press Enter.
The option runs for each entry it is typed next to, in order.
:PARML.
:PT.5=Display exit point
:PD.Type 5 next to an entry and press Enter to display exit point it.
:PT.8=Work with exit programs
:PD.Type 8 next to an entry and press Enter to work with exit programs
it.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/EPREG'.Exit point registered
:P.The exit point registered shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/EPDEREG'.Allow deregister
:P.The allow deregister shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/EPMAX'.Maximum number of exit programs
:P.The maximum number of exit programs shown for what the display is
about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/EPCOUNT'.Current number of exit programs
:P.The current number of exit programs shown for what the display is
about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/EPADDP'.Preprocessing for add
:P.The preprocessing for add shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/EPADDL'.Library
:P.The library shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/EPADDF'.Format
:P.The format shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/EPRMVP'.Preprocessing for remove
:P.The preprocessing for remove shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/EPRMVL'.Library
:P.The library shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/EPRMVF'.Format
:P.The format shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/EPRTVP'.Preprocessing for retrieve
:P.The preprocessing for retrieve shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/EPRTVL'.Library
:P.The library shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/EPRTVF'.Format
:P.The format shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/EPCHG'.Allow change
:P.The allow change shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/EPMSGF'.Description message file
:P.The description message file shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/EPMSGL'.Library
:P.The library shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/EPMSGID'.Message ID
:P.The message ID shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKEXITPGM/OPT'.Option
:P.Type the number of an option next to an entry and press Enter. The
options the list allows are shown above it; F1 on one of them explains
it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PGMNBR'.Exit        Program      Number
:P.The exit Program Number of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PGM'.Exit          Program
:P.The exit Program of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PGMLIB'.Library
:P.The library of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKEXITPGM/OPTIONS'.Options
:P.Type an option number next to one or more entries and press Enter.
The option runs for each entry it is typed next to, in order.
:PARML.
:PT.1=Add
:PD.Type 1 next to an entry and press Enter to add it.
:PT.4=Remove
:PD.Type 4 next to an entry and press Enter to remove it.
:PT.5=Display
:PD.Type 5 next to an entry and press Enter to display it.
:PT.10=Replace
:PD.Type 10 next to an entry and press Enter to replace it.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PGTHDS'.Threadsafe
:P.The threadsafe shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PGMTA'.Multithreaded job action
:P.The multithreaded job action shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PGCCSID'.Exit program data CCSID
:P.The exit program data CCSID shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PGDTALEN'.Length of exit program data
:P.The length of exit program data shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PGDATA'.Exit program data
:P.The exit program data shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PGTEXT'.Text description
:P.The text description shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
